  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU-LINK - RAWABET II - EU Support to the Securitisation of the Ceasefire Area in Libya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The proposed action aims at reinforcing stability, rule of law, and institutional reunification of security and military institutions in and around the ceasefire area, through supporting strategic cooperation and operational integration of Eastern and Western security institutions in Libya. &lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
